Priya

Thank you for the plan. I went over to the unit this morning with it and walked the lot.

The yard, the loading bay and spaces 7 and 8 are all right. The bin store is not. As drawn it sits next to the loading bay, which is where we bring the bread in and out. For food hygiene it has to go on the east side of the unit, well away from the loading bay, and ideally where the van doesn't pass it. Please get the plan changed before we sign.

The break terms are fine by me. The deposit is acceptable as long as it comes back to us after three years of rent paid on time.

One thing I can't judge: what will the service charge cost us each year? Fiona Lund said the share was 8.5% but not what that is in pounds.

